# docs/ is math/Lean-notation-heavy throughout (V', F_a, B_ba, X_cross,
# ...): every file mixes bare underscores in identifiers with real
# _emphasis_ spans, which prettier's markdown emphasis normalizer
# repeatedly mis-scopes, corrupting content (e.g. c_a+c_b -> c*a+c_b) --
# not merely reformatting. At least 5 files were already hit before this
# was caught. Ignoring the whole directory rather than files one at a
# time, since every file here is written in the same notation and any of
# them is equally exposed.
docs/**/*.md
